    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάστωρ:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατήρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαίστωρ</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥατάναν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τορύνην</span>, Id. (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρατάναν</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοταρία</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάτερος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		
			Comp. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾴδιος</span> (q. v.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥατίζει:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβεύει</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥατιχεύειν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρᾶσθαι</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝράτρα</span></b> , Elean for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήτρα</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥατῶνα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεκτῆρα, σφαγέα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαυλόν</span></b> : <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγραυλον, ἄγροικον</span>, Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
